rtened consistently with the road plane.\nKeep all other parts of the image unchanged: exactly three equal horizontal panels, forest / compacted-sand desert / snowy winter, three amber lamps on each existing starter board, no road centre dashes, no text/numbers/logos, same mature matte cel-shaded 3D style, square 1:1 framing.",
